<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170654889475" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Nemtokake Nilai Ekspresi</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654968998">Ing sawetara tuladha pungkasan, kita nggawe ekspresi luwih prasaja kanthi nggunakake urutan operasi itung. Saiki kita bakal nemtokake nilai sawetara ekspresi—maneh kanthi manut urutan operasi itung. <emphasis effect="bold">Nemtokake nilai ekspresi</emphasis> ateges nggoleki nilai ekspresi nalika variabele diganti nganggo wilangan tartamtu.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654969001">
<title>Nemtokake Nilai Ekspresi</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655161751"><term id="term-00018">Nemtokake nilai ekspresi</term> ateges nggoleki nilai ekspresi nalika variabele diganti nganggo wilangan tartamtu.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655353204">Kanggo nemtokake nilai ekspresi, gantia variabel ing ekspresi nganggo wilangan kasebut, banjur gawea ekspresine luwih prasaja.</para>
<example id="fs-id1170654889272">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654889274">
<problem id="fs-id1170655154711">
<para id="fs-id1170655154713">Temtokna nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655177952">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1166424830192"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167836329359" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar nduweni rong kolom, kanthi pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing kiwa, teks muni “Nalika x padha karo 5.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 7x dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore ana ekspresi kanthi 5 minangka gantine x: 7, bukak tandha kurung, 5, tutup tandha kurung, dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Pingake.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 35 dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Kurangana.” Ing tengen ana angka 31, yaiku wujud prasaja saka ekspresi kasebut."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836295066" alt="Teks 'nalika x = 5' ditampilake ing latar putih, kanthi angka 5 dicethakake nganggo warna abang samar."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829597558" alt="Ekspresi matematika '7x-4' ditampilake ing latar putih, dumadi saka angka 7, variabel x, tandha kurang, lan angka 4."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833076771" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake 7 dipingake karo 5, banjur asile dikurangi 4, ditulis minangka 7(5)-4. Angka 5 dicethakake nganggo warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836554298" alt="Gambar nuduhake '35-4' kanthi tulisan klawu peteng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836507263" alt="Angka '31' katon cetha ing pojok tengen ndhuwur ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_009e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
<para id="fs-id1167829683833"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167833047529" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar nduweni rong kolom, kanthi pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing kiwa, teks muni “Nalika x padha karo 1.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 7x dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore ana ekspresi kanthi 1 minangka gantine x: 7, bukak tandha kurung, 1, tutup tandha kurung, dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Pingake.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 7 dikurangi 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Kurangana.” Ing tengen ana angka 3, yaiku wujud prasaja saka ekspresi kasebut."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829597755" alt="Teks 'nalika x = 1' ditampilake ing latar putih, kanthi angka 1 dicethakake nganggo warna abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836492302" alt="Ekspresi matematika '7x-4' ditampilake ing latar putih, dumadi saka angka 7, variabel x, tandha kurang, lan angka 4."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry/>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836296392" alt="Ekspresi matematika muni '7(1)-4', kanthi angka 1 dicethakake nganggo warna abang sing cetha."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010c_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingake.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167836294733" alt="Ekspresi 7-4 ditampilake ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010d_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana.</entry>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167833014906" alt="Katon saka cedhak angka 3 sing gedhé lan awarna klawu peteng ing latar putih resik."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_010e_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654936461" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654920156">
<problem id="fs-id1170654920158">
<para id="fs-id1170655196807">Temtokna nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654913926">
<para id="fs-id1170654913929"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 13 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 5</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170654968085" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654928390">
<problem id="fs-id1170654928392">
<para id="fs-id1170654928394">Temtokna nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654941204">
<para id="fs-id1170655068157"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 8 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 16</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655213474">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655213476">
<problem id="fs-id1170655213478">
<para id="fs-id1170655129489">Kanggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> temtokna nilai <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943583">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1166424780807"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167829717426" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar nduweni rong kolom, kanthi pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing larik kapisan, kolom kiwa kosong lan ing tengen ana suku x kuadrat. Ing larik sabanjure, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Gantia x nganggo 4.” Ing tengen ana suku 4 kuadrat. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Gunakna definisi eksponen.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 4 ping 4. Ing larik pungkasan, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Gawea luwih prasaja.” Ing tengen ana angka 16, yaiku asile nalika x diganti nganggo 4."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
<entry/>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167826170152" alt="Gambar nuduhake teks 'Gantia x nganggo 4.' kanthi tulisan sans-serif klawu lan angka 4 dicethakake nganggo warna abang ing latar putih polos."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_011a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry align="center"><media id="fs-id1167836526102" alt="Katon saka cedhak angka 4 gedhé awarna abang sing dipangkatake 2."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_011b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Gunakna definisi eksponen. </entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Gawea luwih prasaja.</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table></para>
<para id="fs-id1167836730046"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <newline/>
<table id="fs-id1167836504155" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar nduweni rong kolom, kanthi pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Larik pambuka nuduhake ekspresi asli kanthi variabel ing pangkate ing kolom tengen. Ing larik sabanjure, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Gantia x nganggo 4.” Ing tengen ana suku 3 pangkat 4. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Gunakna definisi eksponen.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 3 ping 3 ping 3 ping 3. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Gawea luwih prasaja.” Ing tengen ana angka 81, yaiku nilai ekspresi nalika x diganti nganggo 4."><label/><tgroup cols="2">
 <tbody>
  <row>
<entry/>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mtext>x</m:mtext></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><media id="fs-id1167829692365" alt="Teks 'Gantia x nganggo 4.' ditampilake kanthi cara digital. Tetembungane awarna klawu peteng, dene angka 4 dicethakake nganggo warna abang jingga lan diterusake titik klawu peteng. Latare putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_012a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
    <entry align="center"><media id="fs-id1167836692989" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake 3 pangkat 4, ditulis minangka 3^4, kanthi 3 minangka wilangan pokok lan 4 minangka eksponen."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_012b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Gunakna definisi eksponen.</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry>Gawea luwih prasaja.</entry>
<entry align="center"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>81</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655120535" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655120539">
<problem id="fs-id1170655202547">
<para id="fs-id1170655202549">Kanggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> temtokna nilai <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654965432">
<para id="fs-id1170654931966"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>64</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655353747" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655353751">
<problem id="fs-id1170655133647">
<para id="fs-id1170655133650">Kanggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> temtokna nilai <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655126552">
<para id="fs-id1170654958705"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>216</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>64</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1170655171250">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655171252">
<problem id="fs-id1170655171254">
<para id="fs-id1170654957369">Temtokna nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655200587">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1169149281503"><table id="fs-id1169148881010" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar nduweni rong kolom, kanthi pituduh ing kiwa lan petungan ing tengen. Ing tengen ndhuwur ana ekspresi 2 ping x kuadrat ditambah 3x ditambah 8. Siji larik ing ngisore, teks ing kiwa muni “Gunakna x padha karo 4.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 2, bukak tandha kurung, 4, tutup tandha kurung, kuadrat, ditambah 3, bukak tandha kurung, 4, tutup tandha kurung, ditambah 8. Siji larik ing ngisore, pituduh ing kiwa muni “Manuta urutan operasi itung.” Ing tengen ana ekspresi 2, bukak tandha kurung, 16, tutup tandha kurung, ditambah 3, bukak tandha kurung, 4, tutup tandha kurung, ditambah 8. Ing ngisore ana ekspresi 32 ditambah 12 ditambah 8. Ing ngisore ana 52, yaiku nilai ekspresi nalika x diganti nganggo 4.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"/>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><media id="fs-id1169149357522" alt="Teks 'Gunakna x = 4.' ditampilake kanthi angka 4 dicethakake nganggo warna abang."><image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_013a_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><media id="fs-id1169149089480" alt="Ekspresi matematika nuduhake 2 ping 4 kuadrat ditambah 3 ping 4 ditambah 8, ditulis minangka 2(4)^2 + 3(4) + 8, kanthi tulisan ireng ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_013b_img_new.jpg"/></media></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Manuta urutan operasi itung.</entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"/>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>32</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"/>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>52</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170655160606" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655160609">
<problem id="fs-id1170654942304">
<para id="fs-id1170654942306">Temtokna nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655209422">
<para id="fs-id1170655209424">40</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655197213" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655197217">
<problem id="fs-id1170655163499">
<para id="fs-id1170655163501">Temtokna nilai <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nalika <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655106382">
<para id="fs-id1170655106384">9</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>